摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Agent-native trading terminal built on DeepSeek Harness. Crypto, US, CN and HK in one three-column GUI, 19+ hot-swappable connectors, dry-run by default with human approval on every live order. BYOK, no data redistribution.","id":"gh:1351235984","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-trading","slug":"zhu1090093659/dsh-trading","topics":["agent-native","ai-agent","cryptocurrency","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-desktop","trading-terminal"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Agent-native trading terminal built on DeepSeek Harness. Crypto, US, CN and HK in one three-column G"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"UI, 19+ hot-swappable connectors, dry-run by default with human approval on every live order. BYOK, "},{"id":"p1s3","text":"no data redistribution."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-trading — Open-Source AI Trading Terminal & Multi-Agent Quantitative Platform"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> **Current Status & Handoff** / **当前状态与交接**：See docs/current-state.md (accepted milestones, fail-cl"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"osed invariants, documentation map)."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**English** | 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**dsh-trading** is an open-source, agent-native AI trading terminal and quantitative investment rese"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"arch platform built on DeepSeek Harness (DSH) and the Cordis microkernel. It unifies **Cryptocurrenc"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"y** (Binance, OKX, Bybit, CCXT), **US Equities** (Alpaca, Interactive Brokers, Yahoo Finance), **Chi"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"na A-Shares** (MiniQMT, Eastmoney, AkShare, Tushare), **Hong Kong Stocks** (Longbridge, Futu, Tiger)"},{"id":"p5s5","text":", and **Chinese Commodity Futures** into a single modular workspace."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Combining TradingView Lightweight Charts v5, role-based multi-agent teams (Master, Researcher, Trade"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"r, Risk Reviewer), built-in strategy backtesting, and a zero-trust dual-track human approval gate, d"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"sh-trading bridges the gap between deep AI reasoning and disciplined trading execution."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Quick start · Key features · Why dsh-trading · Supported markets · Agent architecture · FAQ · Docume"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"tart · Key features · Why dsh-trading · Supported markets · Agent architecture · FAQ · Documentation"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"> **Your next trading terminal can also be your AI agent.**\n> *No chumps for the slaughter, just eve"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"rading terminal can also be your AI agent.**\n> *No chumps for the slaughter, just everyday traders.*"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Key Features"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- **All-in-One Multi-Market Workspace:** Follow Crypto (spot & perpetuals), US stocks, China A-share"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"s, Hong Kong equities, and commodity futures in a unified watchlist with real-time quotes, order boo"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"ks, and corporate disclosures.\n- **TradingView Charting & Market Depth Engine:** Center-stage Lightw"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"eight Charts v5 with multi-timeframe switching (5m to weekly), 15+ technical indicators (MA, EMA, MA"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"CD, RSI, Bollinger Bands, KDJ, SuperTrend, TD9), tick-by-tick trades, and crypto derivatives metrics"},{"id":"p10s6","text":" (Open Interest, Funding Rates, Long/Short ratio).\n- **Agent-Native Multi-Agent Orchestration:** A c"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"ollaborative AI team (`master` lead, `instrument-researcher`, `trader`, `risk-reviewer`) that autono"},{"id":"p10s8","text":"mously queries market data tools, performs financial statement analysis, drafts trade plans, and str"},{"id":"p10s9","text":"esses risk scenarios.\n- **Institutional Research Playbooks & Risk Checklists:** Bundled pre-trade ri"},{"id":"p10s10","text":"sk checklists for every market, a 5-step crypto instrument analysis framework, institutional company"},{"id":"p10s11","text":" valuation playbooks, and an append-only dual-track trading journal.\n- **Quantitative Strategy Backt"},{"id":"p10s12","text":"esting:** Formulate and backtest systematic trading signals with `strategy_backtest`, author custom "},{"id":"p10s13","text":"technical indicators, and evaluate historical performance across market cycles.\n- **Zero-Trust Safet"},{"id":"p10s14","text":"y & Dual-Track Approval Gate:** Dry-run simulation by default; live broker orders require explicit o"},{"id":"p10s15","text":"pt-in, interactive human confirmation, and an Ed25519 authority plane. Fail-closed in headless envir"},{"id":"p10s16","text":"onments.\n- **100% Local Privacy (BYOK):** Bring Your Own Keys. API keys and personal trading records"},{"id":"p10s17","text":" live strictly on your local machine. Zero vendor lock-in, zero cloud telemetry, and zero market dat"},{"id":"p10s18","text":" your local machine. Zero vendor lock-in, zero cloud telemetry, and zero market data redistribution."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"First, a question for you:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Of the money you've lost trading, how much of it was lost before you had truly thought it through?"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"You chase a rally and become the exit liquidity. You buy the dip, and it keeps dipping. You cut the "},{"id":"p13s2","text":"loss, and it bounces the moment you're out; you hold, and it grinds you into the deep red. (Veterans"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" don't always dodge these either.)"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Where does the problem lie? Not in luck. In discipline."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Why dsh-trading vs. Alternatives?"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| Dimension | Traditional Trading Terminals (TradingView / Broker Apps) | Generic AI Chatbots (ChatG"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"PT / Copilot sidebars) | **dsh-trading (Agent-Native Terminal)** |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| **Multi-Market Scope** | Fragmented accounts across different apps | Text-only dialogue; no live m"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"arket feeds | **Single unified watchlist & dock: Crypto, US, CN, HK, Futures** |\n| **Real-Time Marke"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"t Depth** | Expensive subscriptions; walled gardens | Hallucinations; zero tick data or order books "},{"id":"p18s4","text":"| **Live L2 order book, tick-by-tick trades, crypto funding rates & open interest** |\n| **Terminal I"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"ntegration** | None or simple external alerts | Chatbox glued next to chart; manual copy-paste | **F"},{"id":"p18s6","text":"irst-class terminal citizen: AI directly drives native quote tools & code analysis** |\n| **Multi-Age"},{"id":"p18s7","text":"nt Architecture** | None | Single prompt / single model | **Hierarchical team: Master (Lead) + Resea"},{"id":"p18s8","text":"rcher + Quant Trader + Risk Reviewer** |\n| **Investment Research** | Manual reading across disparate"},{"id":"p18s9","text":" websites | Generic web-search summaries | **Built-in institutional skills: Market risk checklists, "},{"id":"p18s10","text":"5-step crypto framework, valuation playbooks** |\n| **Strategy & Backtesting** | Proprietary scriptin"},{"id":"p18s11","text":"g (Pine Script) in silos | Cannot run code on real market feeds | **Native `strategy_backtest` engin"},{"id":"p18s12","text":"e & indicator authoring inside the workspace** |\n| **Execution Safety** | Manual clicks or opaque bl"},{"id":"p18s13","text":"ack-box algos | Dangerous unmonitored execution or none | **Dual-track gate: Dry-run by default, hum"},{"id":"p18s14","text":"an approval for live orders, Ed25519 authority** |\n| **Privacy & Credentials** | Keys stored on thir"},{"id":"p18s15","text":"d-party cloud servers | Prompts & data sent to external cloud AI | **100% BYOK stored locally on you"},{"id":"p18s16","text":"r machine, zero data redistribution** |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## What does agent-native mean?"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"What do most \"AI trading tools\" look like? A chat box glued to the side of the chart."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Glued on, not grown in."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"dsh-trading turns that relationship upside down: **the agent is a first-class citizen of the termina"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"l, and the terminal is the agent's body.** Four things separate it from every chatbot you've used:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Architecture at a Glance"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"A modular, layered Cordis microkernel architecture where markets compose cleanly without interferenc"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"modular, layered Cordis microkernel architecture where markets compose cleanly without interference:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Six architectural invariants safeguard the system:\n1. Bundle patches are strictly **insert-only**.\n2"},{"id":"p27s2","text":". Domain knowledge lives in **reusable skills**, not hardcoded prompt hacks.\n3. Dual-track order gat"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"es protect every trade.\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
